  m_Text: "MEMBER 4 \u2014 VINDYA WIJERATHNA\n  \u2022 SE3062 (IS): The Commander AI (Tactical Allocator & Markov Heatmap)\n  \u2022 SE3032 (Graphics): Agent Locomotion Motor, CharacterController Physics & Blend Trees\n\nMEMBER 3 \u2014 CHANUMI\n  \u2022 SE3062 (IS): The Sentinel AI (Area Security, Patrol & Choke-point Guard)\n  \u2022 SE3032 (Graphics): 3D Environment Assets, Models & Character Topology\n\nMEMBER 2 \u2014 PIYUMI\n  \u2022 SE3062 (IS): The Hunter AI (Direct Pursuit & Audio Sensor Simulation)\n  \u2022 SE3032 (Graphics): First-Person Player Controller, Camera & Interaction Physics\n\nMEMBER 1 \u2014 AMAYA\n  \u2022 SE3062 (IS): The Flanker AI (Lateral Pincer Ambushes & Choke Cutoffs)\n  \u2022 SE3032 (Graphics): Ship Deck Environment Architecture, NavMesh Baking & Shaders"
